<h2 class='greeting'>Hi {{username}}! ⚠️</h2>

<p class='message'>
  We noticed suspicious activity on your ChatApp account and have temporarily locked it for your
  security.
</p>

<div class='security-note'>
  <h3>🔒 Account Security Alert</h3>
  <p>
    {{#if isExtended}}
      Your account lock has been extended due to continued suspicious activity during the lock
      period.
    {{else}}
      Your account has been locked due to
      {{reason}}.
    {{/if}}
  </p>
  {{!-- <p><strong>Lock Duration:</strong> {{duration}} minutes</p> --}}
  <p><strong>Unlock Time:</strong> {{unlockTime}}</p>
  {{#if lockCount}}
    <p><strong>Lock Count:</strong> #{{lockCount}} ({{#if isExtended}}Extended{{/if}})</p>
  {{/if}}
</div>

<div class='otp-section'>
  <span class='otp-label'>What to do next:</span>
  <div
    class='otp-code'
    style='background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%); padding: 1rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6;'
  >
    <div style='text-align: left;'>
      <span style='color: white; font-weight: 600;'>1.</span>
      Wait until
      {{unlockTime}}<br />
      <span style='color: white; font-weight: 600;'>2.</span>
      Try logging in again<br />
      {{!-- <span style="color: white; font-weight: 600;">3.</span> {{#if lockCount}}Contact support if this persists{{/if}} --}}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{{#unless isExtended}}
  <div class='divider'></div>

  <p class='message' style='text-align: center; font-style: italic; color: #64748b;'>
    This is an automated security measure to protect your account. Your data remains safe and
    secure.
  </p>
{{/unless}}

<div class='divider'></div>

<div class='security-note' style='background-color: #fef3c7; border-left-color: #f59e0b;'>
  <h3>🛡️ Security Tips</h3>
  <ul style='color: #92400e; margin: 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.6;'>
    <li>Don't share your login credentials with anyone</li>
    <li>Use a strong, unique password for ChatApp</li>
    <li>Enable two-factor authentication when available</li>
    <li>Log out from shared or public devices</li>
    <li>Report suspicious activity immediately</li>
  </ul>
</div>